Name: surfman
Short Name: surfman
URL: https://github.com/servo/surfman
Version: 0.14.0
Revision: d84ea4f647e327091108ad07dca154e6f2dc7b20
Update Mechanism: Manual (tools/import.py surfman, history replayed linearly)
License: MIT OR Apache-2.0 OR MPL-2.0
License File: N/A (see the crate manifests)
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes

Description:
A cross-platform, low-level toolkit for GPU surface management

Local Modifications:
The crates (1) live in third_party/surfman/<crate>, one directory per package; their manifests are rewritten by
tools/flatten.py (path dependencies, inlined workspace inheritance, one version per crate) and patched by
tools/fixups.sh and tools/patches/. Everything else of the upstream is in third_party/surfman/ unchanged.

Crates:
  surfman 0.14.0 third_party/surfman/surfman
